{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure","id":773567,"title":"Primordial Pathways and Willpower Expenditure","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-24T18:49:00-08:00","id":773567,"title":"Primordial Pathways and Willpower Expenditure","content":"Hmm. A question came up and I'm not sure what the answer is. Anyone here care to take a stab at it? <br /> <br /> So the book says the following:<br /> &quot;Beasts can\u2019t simply open Pathways between any realms they<br /> choose. As with many aspects of their Lair, it\u2019s the resonance,<br /> or similarity, between the Lair and somewhere else that affords<br /> access. Opening a Pathway to the exact location from which<br /> the Beast created a Chamber is easiest, but desperate Beasts<br /> and cunning would-be intruders can use similar locations<br /> by spending a point of Willpower during the attempt and<br /> incurring an additional dice penalty based on how well the<br /> location matches.&quot;<br /> <br /> Okay. So far so good. You can open a Pathway to the exact location from which you created a Chamber, or you can open one to a location that is similar by spending a point of willpower and gaining or losing dice according to the chart. Then we have the actual description of the action of opening the Primordial Pathway, which says:<br /> Dice Pool: Wits + Resolve<br /> Action: Instant<br /> Cost: 1 Willpower<br /> <br /> So the actual rules text where the cost of the action is listed says it costs 1 wp. So does this mean it always costs a willpower to open a Primordial Pathway and that opening one to a location that is only similar to the chamber costs an <i>extra</i> point of willpower? Does it simply always cost a willpower to open a Primordial Pathway with no additional willpower cost regardless of where it opens to, or do we go by the text of the preceding paragraph, which says that you only have to spend a point of willpower if you are opening a Primordial Pathway to a location that isn't one you created a Chamber from?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T22:26:50-08:00","id":774559,"title":"","content":"I believe that opening a Pathway to a Lair Chamber should be free, and that the WP is for locales that are less than perfect analogues to the ones used to create the Lair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T00:27:28-08:00","id":774583,"title":"","content":"So, for locations that are either the exact place that a Lair Chamber is created based on, or just happen to be very and almost similar, the WP cost can be waived altogether?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T04:19:51-08:00","id":774671,"title":"","content":"It's listed as costing 1 willpower because that's what it costs <i>most of the time. </i>The actual place it's based on is a clear exception.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T09:50:12-08:00","id":776078,"title":"","content":"So, anyone can open such a pathway into Beast's lair?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615