</div> </div> </div>Likely provokes a Clash of Wills.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-29T02:56:53-08:00","id":776498,"title":"","content":"Only if the Beast is in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T14:15:15-08:00","id":780119,"title":"","content":"So another question re: Primordial Pathways has come up, and rather than start a new thread, I figured I'd just use the same thread I'd already created for an earlier question.<br /> <br /> There are dice modifiers to any roll to open a Primordial Pathway that are based on where the 'external end' of the Pathway is located. At no point is 'external end' actually given a definition for the purposes of these rules. Does 'external end' refer to...<br /> <br /> A: the place you are opening the Pathway to, with the point of origin being the internal and the destination being external?<br /> <br /> or<br /> <br /> B: the end of the pathway that is outside of your Lair?<br /> <br /> My first instinct was to say that it was A based on the logic that the internal end is the end I step into and the external end is the end I emerge from. Point of origin vs destination. It seemed like the obvious answer to me, but then it occurred to me that 'external end' could also refer to 'the end of the Pathway which is not inside your Lair,' so now I'm not so sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T14:19:21-08:00","id":780124,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure it's the end that isn't your lair. Because one end has <i>always</i> got to be your lair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T15:28:14-08:00","id":780177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780124#post780124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pretty sure it's the end that isn't your lair. Because one end has <i>always</i> got to be your lair.</div> </div> </div> </div>So 'external' is always defined relative to the Lair and not relative to your location when opening the pathway? I guess than can work. Well, either way can work -- My problem is that both A and B both make equal sense to me. But I can go with that one for now. Thanks.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T18:00:49-08:00","id":780268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vithrir</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780119#post780119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My first instinct was to say that it was A based on the logic that the internal end is the end I step into and the external end is the end I emerge from. Point of origin vs destination. It seemed like the obvious answer to me, but then it occurred to me that 'external end' could also refer to 'the end of the Pathway which is not inside your Lair,' so now I'm not so sure.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have to ask: is English not your first language? Because this seems like a point of confusion that occurs from conflating &quot;internal&quot; and &quot;external&quot; with &quot;entrance&quot; and &quot;exit,&quot; which isn't something I've seen many people do but seems an etymologically plausible error to make.<br /> <br /> In any case, it seems fairly clear-cut:<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Pathways may be opened either from <b>outside the Lair leading into it, or inside of it leading out</b> to another world. Beasts can\u2019t, however, open Pathways without one \u201cend\u201d of the connection being the Lair. </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=776498#post776498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Only if the Beast is in.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Beast is literally always in.<br /> <br /> <br /> Likewise piggybacking on the existing thread rather than start a new one: Can one open Primordial Pathways using Chamber resonance outside your immediate perception?<br /> <br /> For instance, can you use Soul Communion and open a basement Chamber to feed on intruders to that basement's physical counterpart without visiting the basement in human form?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T18:02:42-08:00","id":780269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780268#post780268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Beast is literally always in.</div> </div> </div> </div>I said Beast; not Horror.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T18:26:38-08:00","id":780286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780269#post780269\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I said Beast; not Horror.</div> </div> </div> </div>My point stands unaltered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T19:03:02-08:00","id":780306,"title":"","content":"I'm dismissing it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T20:15:16-08:00","id":780344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780306#post780306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm dismissing it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Your concession is noted.<br /> <br /> You're attempting to break into <i>the soul of a monster</i> and the Open Gate Gift, which does what you're proposing to do, is contested by what is in practical terms near-identical to what Beasts use for a Clash of Wills regardless of whether the Chamber is occupied, and is part of the possible skillset of the class of hostile character most immediately likely to attempt an unauthorized incursion upon the Lair. Regardless of whether it would provoke a Clash of Wills, it's laughable to assume that a fetish-modified Gift Facet doesn't have to contend with the drawbacks that <i>the people whose powers specifically include the ability to use Primordial Pathways</i> have to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T23:41:52-08:00","id":780424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780268#post780268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to ask: is English not your first language? Because this seems like a point of confusion that occurs from conflating &quot;internal&quot; and &quot;external&quot; with &quot;entrance&quot; and &quot;exit,&quot; which isn't something I've seen many people do but seems an etymologically plausible error to make.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, I'm a native English speaker. If 'external defined in relation to the Lair' seems like the interpretation that is obviously correct to everyone else, then all I can say is, &quot;Huh, weird. Okay, then.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T11:40:10-08:00","id":780641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vithrir</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780424#post780424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nah, I'm a native English speaker. If 'external defined in relation to the Lair' seems like the interpretation that is obviously correct to everyone else, then all I can say is, &quot;Huh, weird. Okay, then.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Isn't that spelled out in text itself? I admit having to reread that section a few times before it started to make sense, but I'm sure I saw that at some point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3323-cmwatford","name":"cmwatford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3323_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T13:18:26-08:00","id":780683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780268#post780268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Likewise piggybacking on the existing thread rather than start a new one: Can one open Primordial Pathways using Chamber resonance outside your immediate perception?<br /> <br /> For instance, can you use Soul Communion and open a basement Chamber to feed on intruders to that basement's physical counterpart without visiting the basement in human form?</div> </div> </div> </div>That... is a really interesting question. I have no idea. At the moment, I don't see any reason why this wouldn't be possible -- you can control your Horror as an instant action, and you can see through its eyes reflexively, and even if it can't leave your Lair, the Horror does appear to be able to open Primordial Pathways, as that is how it feeds on Dreamers: drawing them into the Lair and devouring them... huh.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cmwatford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780641#post780641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't that spelled out in text itself? I admit having to reread that section a few times before it started to make sense, but I'm sure I saw that at some point.</div> </div> </div> </div>After rereading the section in question a few more times, it's making sense to me as well. It isn't actually spelled out, but it is implied.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T16:36:17-08:00","id":780767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780344#post780344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Your concession is noted.<br /> <br /> You're attempting to break into <i>the soul of a monster</i> and the Open Gate Gift, which does what you're proposing to do, is contested by what is in practical terms near-identical to what Beasts use for a Clash of Wills regardless of whether the Chamber is occupied, and is part of the possible skillset of the class of hostile character most immediately likely to attempt an unauthorized incursion upon the Lair. Regardless of whether it would provoke a Clash of Wills, it's laughable to assume that a fetish-modified Gift Facet doesn't have to contend with the drawbacks that <i>the people whose powers specifically include the ability to use Primordial Pathways</i> have to.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not entering the Horror. That's the 'soul of the monster'. The Lair isn't specifically the soul. It's that: it's receptacle. Otherwise, destroying chambers would have much, much more dramatic effect over the Beast than what I could read.<br /> <br /> And the Horror? The Horror can be completely unaware of the break-in, in multiple circumstances.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T18:07:38-08:00","id":780833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=780767#post780767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not entering the Horror. That's the 'soul of the monster'. The Lair isn't specifically the soul. It's that: it's receptacle.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Lair serves as the Begotten equivalent of an Oneiros. Just because the first draft called the Horror the Soul doesn't mean it's capable of existing independently of its context without completely breaking the link that ties the Beast's three points of vulnerability together.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Otherwise, destroying chambers would have much, much more dramatic effect over the Beast than what I could read. </div> </div> </div>Collapsing the Heart kills the Beast just as surely as killing the Horror does. Hard to get more dramatic than that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T05:01:56-08:00","id":781074,"title":"","content":"Yet, the Horror is still a separate entity from the Beast, barring end-game mechanics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T09:13:53-08:00","id":781161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773567-primordial-pathways-and-willpower-expenditure?p=781074#post781074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yet, the Horror is still a separate entity from the Beast, barring end-game mechanics.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, you merge with your Horror every time you travel to your Lair and every time you open a Primordial Pathway (while within the location your Lair is overlaid onto, for the duration that the Pathway is open).<br /> <br /> They really aren't actually separate entities. The Horror is the Beast and the Beast is the Horror. The Horror also has some autonomy, but it would never do anything that you didn't actually want to do on some level. You can think of it as a literal manifestation of a Beast's Id. It is what Beasts have <i>instead of a soul</i>. You can reflexively see through the Horror's eyes at any time. If you want to, you can <b>constantly</b> share the senses of your Horror. You can also control the spiritual &quot;body&quot; of your Horror if you want, though you cannot control both your human body and your Horror's spiritual manifestation at the same time. You pick one or the other. If you choose to prioritize your human body, the Horror will be more or less piloted by your subconscious (or IS your subconscious. It's complicated). If you choose to prioritize your Horror-self, your human body will not run itself. But take an instant action every turn to run your Horror-self inside the Lair that is itself also a manifestation of you and a manifestation of the union between human flesh and nightmare-soul, and you can run around as your Horror basically indefinitely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}